@deliveryUrl = http://localhost:8087
@orderUrl = http://localhost:8088
@deliveryId = 1

### Проверка Order Service
GET {{orderUrl}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Создание доставки: Delivery Service выполнит WebClient-вызов в Order Service
POST {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "courier": "Иван Курьер"
}

### Получение всех доставок — Flux<DeliveryResponse>
GET {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries
Accept: application/json

### Фильтрация реактивного потока
GET {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries?status=DELIVERED&minPrice=2000
Accept: application/json

### Получение одной доставки — Mono<DeliveryResponse>
GET {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Accept: application/json

### SSE-поток состояния (лучше запускать через curl.exe -N)
GET {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### CREATED -> ACCEPTED
PUT {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courier": "Иван Курьер",
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}

### ACCEPTED -> IN_TRANSIT
PUT {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courier": "Иван Курьер",
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT"
}

### IN_TRANSIT -> DELIVERED
PUT {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courier": "Иван Курьер",
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}

### Удаление
DELETE {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}

### Ошибка: заказ отсутствует
POST {{deliveryUrl}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 999,
  "courier": "Иван Курьер"
}
